  "summary_en": "Strategic research and innovation agenda of the European AI, Data and Robotics Association for Horizon Europe 2025-27. It sets missions and six \"big tickets\", including next-generation embodied robots and compliance tools, and promotes sandboxes, testing facilities, standardisation and trustworthy ADR to support European competitiveness and strategic autonomy.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Defines six Big Tickets, including embodied-intelligence robotics and research/tools for compliance.",
   "Calls for regulatory sandboxes and testing and experimentation facilities (TEFs) for real-world testing.",
   "Urges pre-standardisation and European influence on global standards for robotics and AI.",
   "Warns that the AI Act, Data Act, Cyber Resilience Act and machinery rules need fast guidance and compliance support.",
   "Recommends investment, skills programmes and innovation procurement to build European strategic autonomy."
